OL,3,GNEWSAForgotten WW2 coastal airmen added
OL,4,Ato memorial
OL,5,
OL,6,FThree World War Two veterans who served
OL,7,Fin the South West and died in the
OL,8,Fconflict, are among those being added
OL,9,Fto a memorial.
OL,11,FSqn Ldr George Crawford and Pilot
OL,12,FOfficer Kenneth Brian Willson were both
OL,13,Fbased at St Eval RAF base in Cornwall
OL,14,Fwhile Sgt Jack Saul Lockwood was based
OL,15,Fat RAF Chivenor in Devon, as part of
OL,16,FCoastal Command.
OL,18,FCoastal Command was tasked with keeping
OL,19,FBritish seas safe from German U-boats
OL,20,Falong with escorting allied shipping
OL,21,Fconvoys of troops, food and munitions.
OL,23,APub: 01-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
FL,344,340,200,160,0,100
