OL,3,GNEWSAForgotten WW2 coastal airmen added
OL,4,Ato memorial
OL,5,
OL,6,FIt was recently announced 12,500 men
OL,7,Fand women who died while serving with
OL,8,Fthe Coastal Command, part of the Royal
OL,9,FAir Force, would be added to
OL,10,FInternational Bomber Command Centre's
OL,11,FLosses Database.
